  "excerpt": "Recently, QEIF hosted an event in support of World Glaucoma Week. Guests were invited to join us for a free morning tea and information seminar.",
  "body_html": "<p>Recently, QEIF hosted an event in support of World Glaucoma Week.</p>\n<p>Guests were invited to join us for a free morning tea and information seminar with presentations from key stakeholders in the field of glaucoma.</p>\n<p>Thanks to our speakers;</p>\n<ul>\n<li>QEIF CEO Professor Mark Radford</li>\n<li>QEI Clinic’s Dr Brendan Cronin</li>\n<li>QEIF Community Relations Manager Jane Dodds</li>\n<li>Melissa Eckersley, Mother of young QEI glaucoma patient Oscar</li>\n<li>Glaucoma Australia CEO Annie Gibbins</li>\n<li>Head of QIMR Berghofer’s Statistical Genetics Group, Associate Professor Stuart MacGregor</li>\n<li>Quantum’s State Manager Peter Cracknell</li>\n</ul>\n<p>An extra special thanks to all of our guests who attended and showed their support. After an overwhelming amount of positive feedback, we hope to make Glaucoma Day a yearly event!</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3050\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"3024\" sizes=\"(max-width: 4032px) 100vw, 4032px\" src=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2020/03/IMG_9457.jpg\" srcset=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2020/03/IMG_9457.jpg 4032w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2020/03/IMG_9457-300x225.jpg 300w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2020/03/IMG_9457-768x576.jpg 768w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2020/03/IMG_9457-1024x768.jpg 1024w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2020/03/IMG_9457-1430x1073.jpg 1430w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2020/03/IMG_9457-800x600.jpg 800w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2020/03/IMG_9457-400x300.jpg 400w\" width=\"4032\"/></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3051\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"3024\" sizes=\"(max-width: 4032px) 100vw, 4032px\" src=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2020/03/8764586.jpg\" srcset=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2020/03/8764586.jpg 4032w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2020/03/8764586-300x225.jpg 300w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2020/03/8764586-768x576.jpg 768w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2020/03/8764586-1024x768.jpg 1024w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2020/03/8764586-1430x1073.jpg 1430w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2020/03/8764586-800x600.jpg 800w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2020/03/8764586-400x300.jpg 400w\" width=\"4032\"/></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3052\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"3024\" sizes=\"(max-width: 4032px) 100vw, 4032px\" src=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2020/03/2.jpg\" srcset=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2020/03/2.jpg 4032w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2020/03/2-300x225.jpg 300w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2020/03/2-768x576.jpg 768w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2020/03/2-1024x768.jpg 1024w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2020/03/2-1430x1073.jpg 1430w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2020/03/2-800x600.jpg 800w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2020/03/2-400x300.jpg 400w\" width=\"4032\"/></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3053\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2445\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 3935px) 100vw, 3935px\" src=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2020/03/IMG_2750-1.jpeg\" srcset=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2020/03/IMG_2750-1.jpeg 3935w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2020/03/IMG_2750-1-300x186.jpeg 300w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2020/03/IMG_2750-1-768x477.jpeg 768w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2020/03/IMG_2750-1-1024x636.jpeg 1024w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2020/03/IMG_2750-1-1430x889.jpeg 1430w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2020/03/IMG_2750-1-800x497.jpeg 800w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2020/03/IMG_2750-1-400x249.jpeg 400w\" width=\"3935\"/></p>\n<p> </p>",
